#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:89
msgctxt "placeholder for affiliate user roles setting"
msgid "Select user roles"
msgstr "Gebruikersrollen selecteren"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:93
msgctxt "Excluded products setting name"
msgid "Excluded products"
msgstr "Uitgesloten producten"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:94
msgctxt "Description for Excluded products setting"
msgid "All products are eligible for affiliate commission by default. If you want to exclude some, list them here."
msgstr "Alle producten komen standaard in aanmerking voor affiliate commissie. Als je sommige producten wilt uitsluiten, kun je ze hier vermelden."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:102
msgctxt "placeholder for excluded products setting"
msgid "Search by product name or ID"
msgstr "Zoeken op productnaam of ID"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:107
msgctxt "Approval method setting name"
msgid "Approval method"
msgstr "Goedkeuringsmethode"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:108
msgctxt "Description for Approval method setting"
msgid "Automatically approve all submissions via Affiliate Registration Form - no manual review needed"
msgstr "Automatisch alle aanmeldingen goedkeuren via het Affiliate Registratieformulier - geen handmatige controle nodig"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:112
msgctxt "Description for Approval method setting tooltip"
msgid "Disabling this will require you to review and approve affiliates yourself. They won't become affiliates until you approve."
msgstr "Als je dit uitschakelt, moet je affiliates zelf beoordelen en goedkeuren. Ze worden pas affiliates als jij ze goedkeurt."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:116
msgctxt "Cookie duration setting name"
msgid "Cookie duration (in days)"
msgstr "Duur van het cookie (in dagen)"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:117
msgctxt "Description for Cookie duration setting"
msgid "Use 0 for \"session only\" referrals. Use 36500 for 100 year / lifetime referrals. If someone makes a purchase within these many days of their first referred visit, affiliate will be credited for the sale."
msgstr "Gebruik 0 voor \"alleen sessie\" verwijzingen. Gebruik 36500 voor 100 jaar / levenslange verwijzingen. Als iemand een aankoop doet binnen deze dagen na het eerste doorverwezen bezoek, wordt de affiliate gecrediteerd voor de verkoop."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:128
msgctxt "Affiliate manager email setting name"
msgid "Affiliate manager email"
msgstr "Affiliate manager e-mail"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:129
msgctxt "Description for Affiliate manager email setting"
msgid "Affiliates will see a link to contact you in their dashboard - and the link will point to this email address. Leave this field blank to hide the contact link."
msgstr "Affiliates zien een link om contact met je op te nemen in hun dashboard - en de link verwijst naar dit e-mailadres. Laat dit veld leeg om de contactlink te verbergen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:132
msgctxt "Placeholder for Affiliate manager email setting"
msgid "Enter email address"
msgstr "E-mailadres invoeren"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:137
msgctxt "Affiliate landing pages setting name"
msgid "Affiliate landing pages"
msgstr "Affiliate landingspagina's"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:138
msgctxt "Description for Affiliate landing pages setting"
msgid "Enable this to allow assigning landing pages, posts, or products to an affiliate"
msgstr "Schakel dit in om landingspagina's, berichten of producten toe te wijzen aan een affiliate"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:139
msgctxt "Description tip for Affiliate landing pages setting"
msgid "Use the <code>Affiliate Landing Page</code> meta box on a single page, post, or product to assign it to an affiliate which they can promote without using an affiliate link. The commission will be calculated based on the commission plan."
msgstr "Gebruik het metavak <code>Affiliate Landing Page</code> op een pagina, bericht of product om het toe te wijzen aan een affiliate die het kan promoten zonder een affiliate-link te gebruiken. De commissie wordt berekend op basis van het commissieplan."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:405
msgctxt "Admin setting name for Payout invoice"
msgid "Payout invoice"
msgstr "Uitbetalingsfactuur"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:406
msgctxt "Admin setting description for Payout invoice"
msgid "Enable this to generate an invoice for each commission payout"
msgstr "Schakel dit in om een factuur te genereren voor elke uitbetaling van commissies"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:411
msgctxt "Admin setting description tip for Payout invoice"
msgid "When enabled, you can print invoices from the Payouts tab. To allow affiliates to print their invoices, enable the \"Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice\" below."
msgstr "Als deze optie is ingeschakeld, kun je facturen afdrukken vanaf het tabblad Uitbetalingen. Als je affiliates wilt toestaan hun facturen af te drukken, schakel je de optie \"Affiliates tonen en toestaan hun factuur af te drukken\" hieronder in."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:415
msgctxt "Admin setting description for Logo for payout invoice"
msgid "Upload a logo representing your shop or business. It will be shown on the invoice."
msgstr "Upload een logo dat je winkel of bedrijf vertegenwoordigt. Dit wordt weergegeven op de factuur."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:425
msgctxt "Admin setting name for Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice"
msgid "Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice"
msgstr "Affiliates tonen en toestaan om hun factuur af te drukken"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:430
msgctxt "Admin setting description tip for Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice"
msgid "When enabled, a new column to print invoices will be visible in the affiliate's account > Reports > Payout History."
msgstr "Als deze optie is ingeschakeld, is er een nieuwe kolom voor het afdrukken van facturen zichtbaar in de account van de affiliate > Rapporten > Uitbetalingsgeschiedenis."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:640
msgctxt "Button text for media upload button"
msgid "Upload image"
msgstr "Afbeelding uploaden"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:641
msgctxt "Button text for media change button"
msgid "Change image"
msgstr "Afbeelding wijzigen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:676
msgctxt "Button name for remove media"
msgid "Remove image"
msgstr "Afbeelding verwijderen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:115
msgctxt "free plugin name"
msgid "Affiliate Store Credit Payouts Integration"
msgstr "Affiliate winkel credit betalingen integratie"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:136
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Refund period"
msgstr "Terugbetalingstermijn"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:137
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "A refund isn't a successful referral. Therefore, enter how many days to wait before paying commissions for successful referrals. If you don't have a refund period, enter 0. Each referral within the refund period will be marked to show the remaining days in the refund period. In case automatic payouts are enabled, referrals within the refund period will not be included in it."
msgstr "Een terugbetaling is geen succesvolle verwijzing. Voer daarom in hoeveel dagen je wilt wachten voordat je commissies uitbetaalt voor succesvolle doorverwijzingen. Als je geen terugbetalingsperiode hebt, voer dan 0 in. Elke verwijzing binnen de terugbetalingsperiode zal gemarkeerd worden om de resterende dagen in de terugbetalingsperiode weer te geven. Als automatische uitbetalingen zijn ingeschakeld, worden verwijzingen binnen de terugbetalingsperiode niet meegenomen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:146
msgctxt "placeholder for refund window setting"
msgid "Enter the number of days. Default is 30."
msgstr "Voer het aantal dagen in. De standaardinstelling is 30."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:149
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Minimum affiliate commission for payout"
msgstr "Minimum affiliate commissie voor uitbetaling"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:150
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "An affiliate earnings must reach this minimum threshold value to qualify for commission payouts. This setting ensures that only eligible order's referrals are included for payouts. In case automatic payouts are enabled, order referrals below this threshold will not qualify for payouts."
msgstr "De verdiensten van een affiliate moeten deze minimumdrempelwaarde bereiken om in aanmerking te komen voor commissie-uitbetalingen. Deze instelling zorgt ervoor dat alleen orders die in aanmerking komen worden uitbetaald. Als automatische uitbetalingen zijn ingeschakeld, zullen orderverwijzingen onder deze drempelwaarde niet in aanmerking komen voor uitbetalingen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:159
msgctxt "placeholder for payment day setting"
msgid "Enter minimum commission amount. Default is 50."
msgstr "Voer het minimumcommissiebedrag in. De standaardinstelling is 50."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:172
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "PayPal email address"
msgstr "PayPal e-mailadres"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:173
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "Allow affiliates to enter their PayPal email address from their My Account > Affiliates > Profile for PayPal payouts"
msgstr "Sta affiliates toe om hun PayPal e-mailadres in te voeren vanuit hun Mijn Account > Affiliates > Profiel voor PayPal uitbetalingen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:174
msgctxt "setting description tip"
msgid "Disabling this will not show it to affiliates in their account."
msgstr "Als je dit uitschakelt, wordt het niet getoond aan affiliates in hun account."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:181
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Payout via PayPal"
msgstr "Uitbetaling via PayPal"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:312
msgctxt "placeholder for allowed coupon types for payouts"
msgid "Select the coupon type..."
msgstr "Selecteer het coupontype..."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:206
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Payout via Stripe"
msgstr "Uitbetaling via Stripe"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:207
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "Pay commissions via Stripe by allowing affiliates to link their Stripe accounts to your store"
msgstr "Betaal commissies via Stripe door affiliates toe te staan hun Stripe-accounts aan je winkel te koppelen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:212
msgctxt "setting description tip"
msgid "Disabling this will stop payouts through Stripe."
msgstr "Als je dit uitschakelt, stopt de uitbetaling via Stripe."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:216
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Stripe Publishable Key"
msgstr "Stripe publiceerbare sleutel"

#. translators: 1: Link to Stripe API keys dashboard 2: Stripe Connect documentation for testing with OAuth
#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:219
#, php-format
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "To locate, go to <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Developers > API keys ></a> <strong>Standard keys > Publishable key</strong> (more info: <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">%2$s</a>). Mandatory to add this for commission payouts to work."
msgstr "Ga hiervoor naar <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Ontwikkelaars > API-sleutels ></a> <strong>Standaardsleutels > Publiceerbare sleutel</strong> (meer info: <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">%2$s</a>). Verplicht om dit toe te voegen om commissie-uitbetalingen te laten werken."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:225
msgctxt "Placeholder for Stripe Publishable Key setting"
msgid "Values starting with \"pk_\""
msgstr "Waarden die beginnen met \"pk_\""

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:235
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Stripe Secret Key"
msgstr "Stripe geheime sleutel"

#. translators: 1: Link to Stripe dashboard 2: Stripe Connect documentation for testing with OAuth
#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:238
#, php-format
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "To locate, go to <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Developers > API keys ></a> <strong>Standard keys > Secret key > Reveal live key</strong> (more info: <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">%2$s</a>). Mandatory to add this for commission payouts to work."
msgstr "Ga hiervoor naar <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Developers > API keys ></a> <strong>Standaard keys > Secret key > Reveal live key</strong> (meer info: <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">%2$s</a>). Verplicht om dit toe te voegen om commissie uitbetalingen te laten werken."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:244
msgctxt "Placeholder for Stripe Secret Key setting"
msgid "Values starting with \"sk_\""
msgstr "Waarden die beginnen met \"sk_\""

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:254
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Stripe Client ID"
msgstr "Stripe klant-ID"

#. translators: 1: Link to Stripe dashboard 2: Stripe Connect documentation for testing with OAuth
#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:257
#, php-format
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "To locate, go to <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Settings > Connect > Onboarding options > OAuths ></a> <strong>Live mode client ID</strong> (more info: <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">%2$s</a>). Mandatory to add this for commission payouts to work."
msgstr "Ga hiervoor naar <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Instellingen > Verbinden > Onboarding-opties > OAuths ></a> <strong>Live-modus klant-ID</strong> (meer info: <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">%2$s</a>). Verplicht toe te voegen om commissie-uitbetalingen te laten werken."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:263
msgctxt "Placeholder for Stripe Client ID setting"
msgid "Account ID - minimum 35 characters"
msgstr "Account-ID - minimaal 35 tekens"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:273
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Add redirect URIs"
msgstr "URI's omleiden toevoegen"

#. translators: 1: Link to Stripe dashboard 2: current site's affiliate's my account endpoint for resources/profile tab
#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:276
#, php-format
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "A <strong>Redirection URI is required</strong> when users connect their account to your site.<br><br>Go to <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Settings > Connect > Onboarding options > OAuths ></a> <strong>Redirects</strong> section and add the following URl to redirect: <code>%2$s</code><br><br>Redirects URI can be defined on test and live mode, we would recommend to test both scenarios."
msgstr "Een <strong>Redirection URI is vereist</strong> wanneer gebruikers hun account verbinden met uw site.<br><br>Ga naar <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Stripe Dashboard > Settings > Connect > Onboarding options > OAuths ></a> sectie <strong>Redirects</strong> en voeg de volgende URl toe om te redirecten: <code>%2$s</code><br><br>Redirects URI kan worden gedefinieerd in test- en live-modus. We raden u aan beide scenario's te testen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:284
msgctxt "setting description tip"
msgid "It is mandatory to set this in your Stripe account to process commission payouts. Otherwise, payouts won't be processed."
msgstr "Het is verplicht om dit in te stellen in je Stripe account om commissie uitbetalingen te verwerken. Anders worden uitbetalingen niet verwerkt."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:326
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Automatic payouts"
msgstr "Automatische uitbetalingen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:335
msgctxt "setting name for automatic payouts to include affiliates"
msgid "Automatic payouts include affiliates"
msgstr "Automatische uitbetalingen omvatten affiliates"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:344
msgctxt "Admin setting placeholder to search affiliates to include them for automatic payouts"
msgid "Search affiliates by email, username or name"
msgstr "Zoek partners op e-mail, gebruikersnaam of naam"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:352
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Maximum commission to pay an affiliate"
msgstr "Maximale commissie voor een affiliate"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:353
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "Set the maximum commission an affiliate can receive in automatic payouts. Set it to 0 if no limit. This setting ensures automatic payouts stay within a specified limit. Referrals exceeding this limit won't be included in automatic payouts."
msgstr "Stel de maximale commissie in die een affiliate kan ontvangen in automatische uitbetalingen. Stel het in op 0 als er geen limiet is. Deze instelling zorgt ervoor dat automatische uitbetalingen binnen een opgegeven limiet blijven. Verwijzingen die deze limiet overschrijden worden niet opgenomen in automatische uitbetalingen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:364
msgctxt "placeholder for payment day setting"
msgid "Enter maximum commission amount. Default is 0."
msgstr "Voer het maximale commissiebedrag in. De standaardinstelling is 0."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:367
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Commission payout day"
msgstr "Commissie uitbetalingsdag"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:77
msgctxt "Admin setting description"
msgid "Include affiliate referral details in the WooCommerce New order email (if enabled)"
msgstr "Neem verwijzingsgegevens van partners op in de e-mail Nieuwe bestelling van WooCommerce (indien ingeschakeld)"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:86
msgctxt "setting name for tracking parameter name"
msgid "Tracking param name"
msgstr "Parameternaam volgen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:90
msgctxt "Tracking parameter setting placeholder text"
msgid "Leaving this blank will use default value ref"
msgstr "Als u dit leeg laat, wordt de standaardwaarde ref gebruikt"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:94
msgctxt "setting name to personalize affiliate identifier"
msgid "Personalize affiliate identifier"
msgstr "Affiliate identificatie personaliseren"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:95
msgctxt "setting description for personalizing affiliate identifier"
msgid "Allow affiliates to use something other than {user_id} as referral identifier"
msgstr "Affiliates toestaan om iets anders dan {user_id} te gebruiken als verwijzingsidentificatie"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:99
msgctxt "setting description tip for personalizing affiliate identifier"
msgid "Good idea to keep this on. This allows \"friendly\" looking links - because people can use their brand name instead of {user_id}."
msgstr "Goed idee om dit aan te houden. Dit laat \"vriendelijk\" uitziende links toe - omdat mensen hun merknaam kunnen gebruiken in plaats van {user_id}."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:103
msgctxt "setting name for pretty affiliate links"
msgid "Pretty affiliate links"
msgstr "Mooie affiliate links"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:104
msgctxt "setting description for pretty affiliate links"
msgid "Automatically convert default affiliate referral links to beautiful links"
msgstr "Standaard affiliate verwijzingslinks automatisch converteren naar mooie links"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:126
msgctxt "setting name for coupons for referral"
msgid "Coupons for referral"
msgstr "Coupons voor doorverwijzing"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:127
msgctxt "setting description of using coupons for referral"
msgid "Use coupons for referral - along with affiliated links"
msgstr "Gebruik coupons voor doorverwijzing - samen met aangesloten links"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:131
msgctxt "setting description tip of using coupons for referral"
msgid "Use the <code>Assign to affiliate</code> option while creating a coupon to link the coupon with an affiliate. Whenever that coupon is used, specified affiliate will be credited for the sale."
msgstr "Gebruik de optie <code>Toewijzen aan partner</code> bij het maken van een coupon om de coupon te koppelen aan een partner. Telkens wanneer die coupon wordt gebruikt, wordt de opgegeven affiliate gecrediteerd voor de verkoop."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:164
msgctxt "setting name for multi-tier affiliate program"
msgid "Multi-tier affiliate program"
msgstr "Multi-tier affiliate programma"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:165
msgctxt "Description for multi-tier affiliate program"
msgid "Allow existing affiliates to invite others to join your affiliate program, earning extra commissions from their referrals"
msgstr "Sta bestaande affiliates toe om anderen uit te nodigen om deel te nemen aan je affiliate programma en verdien extra commissies met hun doorverwijzingen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:166
msgctxt "Description tip for multi-tier affiliate program"
msgid "Existing (parent) affiliates will receive commissions on referrals of children affiliates - as long as active. Disabling this will remove the relationship as well as prevent commissions."
msgstr "Bestaande (ouder) affiliates ontvangen commissies op verwijzingen van kinderen affiliates - zolang ze actief zijn. Door dit uit te schakelen wordt de relatie verwijderd en worden commissies voorkomen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:173
msgctxt "setting name to credit first or last affiliate during referral"
msgid "Credit first/last affiliate"
msgstr "Krediet eerste/laatste filiaal"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:177
msgctxt "Option to credit first affiliate"
msgid "First - Credit the first affiliate who referred the customer."
msgstr "Eerste - Crediteer de eerste partner die de klant heeft doorverwezen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:178
msgctxt "Option to credit last affiliate"
msgid "Last - Credit the last/latest affiliate who referred the customer."
msgstr "Laatste - Crediteer de laatste affiliate die de klant heeft doorverwezen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:183
msgctxt "setting name for affiliate self-refer"
msgid "Affiliate self-refer"
msgstr "Affiliate zelfverwijzer"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:184
msgctxt "Description for affiliate self-refer setting"
msgid "Allow affiliates to earn commissions on their own orders"
msgstr "Laat affiliates commissies verdienen op hun eigen bestellingen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:185
msgctxt "Description tip for affiliate self-refer setting"
msgid "Disabling this will not record a commission if an affiliate uses their own referral link/coupons during orders."
msgstr "Als je dit uitschakelt, wordt er geen commissie geregistreerd als een affiliate zijn eigen doorverwijslink/coupons gebruikt tijdens bestellingen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:192
msgctxt "setting name to show affiliate referral link for a product"
msgid "Show affiliate referral link for a product"
msgstr "Affiliate doorverwijslink voor een product tonen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:193
msgctxt "setting description of showing affiliate referral link for a product"
msgid "Allow affiliates to quickly copy their affiliate referral link for a specific product from a single product page"
msgstr "Laat affiliates snel hun affiliate doorverwijslink kopiëren voor een specifiek product vanaf een enkele productpagina"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:197
msgctxt "setting description tip for showing affiliate referral link for a product"
msgid "When enabled, a \"Click to copy referral link\" button will appear for active affiliates on all products except the ones listed under \"Excluded products\" and assigned to the affiliate via a \"Landing page\"."
msgstr "Als deze optie is ingeschakeld, verschijnt er een knop \"Klik om doorverwijslink te kopiëren\" voor actieve affiliates op alle producten, behalve op de producten die zijn vermeld onder \"Uitgesloten producten\" en die zijn toegewezen aan de affiliate via een \"Landingspagina\"."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:201
msgctxt "setting name to send referral details to admin"
msgid "Send referral details to admin"
msgstr "Stuur verwijzingsgegevens naar admin"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:203
msgctxt "setting description tip for sending referral details to admin"
msgid "Disabling this will not include affiliate referral details in the email to admin."
msgstr "Als je dit uitschakelt, worden de verwijzingsgegevens van de partner niet opgenomen in de e-mail naar de beheerder."

#. translators: Link to the affiliate registration form page
#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-registration-form-admin-settings.php:70
#, php-format
msgctxt "affiliate registration form link"
msgid "%s | "
msgstr "%s |"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-registration-form-admin-settings.php:71
msgctxt "registration form link text"
msgid "Review and publish form"
msgstr "Formulier beoordelen en publiceren"

#. translators: shortcode for affiliate registration form
